## 7. Investments Page

This is a critical section of the application.

I may invest in multiple businesses, purchase physical assets, lend money to another person or business, or fund a new business. I need to understand how much money has been invested, how much principal has been returned, how much profit or interest has been received, and how each investment has performed.

### A. Create an Investment

